sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Player as Player browser
    participant WS as API Gateway WebSocket
    participant Game as Domain Expansion Lambda
    participant State as DynamoDB
    participant Viewer as Battle viewer
    participant REST as API Gateway REST
    participant Engine as Selected commentary engine
    participant Polly as Amazon Polly

    Player->>Player: MediaPipe recognizes hand landmarks
    Player->>WS: challenge.succeeded(recognizedAt)
    WS->>Game: WebSocket command
    Game->>State: Validate revision, deadline, and idempotency
    Game->>State: Persist score and resolution
    Game-->>WS: Authoritative room.snapshot
    WS-->>Viewer: Updated match state
    WS-->>Player: Updated match state

    Viewer->>REST: POST /api/live-status with Cognito token
    REST->>Game: Authorized Lambda proxy request
    Game->>Engine: Invoke strands_local, agentcore_runtime, or openclaw
    Note over Game,Engine: No cross-engine fallback
    Engine-->>Game: Commentary text
    opt AWS TTS selected
        Game->>Polly: SynthesizeSpeech
        Polly-->>Game: MP3 audio
    end
    Game-->>REST: Commentary JSON and optional signed audio URL
    REST-->>Viewer: HTTPS response
    Viewer->>Viewer: Display commentary and play speech
